A lot..
The thing is..

310
00:24:17,201 --> 00:24:20,017
We kill each other on the streets.

311
00:24:20,041 --> 00:24:23,817
And you guys lay down your lives
for the country.

312
00:24:23,841 --> 00:24:26,817
And no matter how old you are

313
00:24:26,841 --> 00:24:29,201
